even Demo Notice1. Schedule: 10/8 (Thu) 09:00 - 10/26 (Mon) 23:59 UTC2. How to Participate: You can ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T10:30:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925697","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5019180-1844115010488833","game_id":"steam-5019180","kind":"announcement","title":"Epic Seven Participation Preview Notice","summary":"Hello, Heirs. This is Epic Seven. With the official STEAM launch of Epic Seven right around the corner!Epic Seven is joining , a festival where you can preview upcoming games on STEAM all in one place! 🎉 Through this event, you will be able to experience Epic Seven's new play environment prior to its official STEAM release, so we ask for all our Heirs' enthusiastic interest and participation. Please refer to the details below for more information. ■ Epic Seven Participation Preview Notice\\ - Sch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T11:27:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488833","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5019180-1841579228670722","game_id":"steam-5019180","kind":"announcement","title":"Epic Seven STEAM Store Page Release Event Notice","summary":"Hello, Heirs. This is Epic Seven. Epic Seven is officially coming to STEAM! 🥳🎉 To celebrate the release of the STEAM client with you, we've prepared various events and benefits! Enjoy a smooth Epic Seven experience on the STEAM client, join the events, and claim abundant rewards! Please refer to the details below for more information. ■ Event 1. STEAM Wishlist EventTo celebrate the opening of the Epic Seven STEAM Store Page, the STEAM Wishlist Event is now live! \\08/22 (Sat) STEAM Store Page Ope","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T04:15:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670722","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5019180-1841579228670590","game_id":"steam-5019180","kind":"announcement","title":"FAQs Regarding Steam","summary":"Hello, Heirs. This is Epic Seven. To celebrate the launch of Epic Seven on Steam, we have prepared an FAQ covering key information Heirs may want to know regarding Steam use. Please check below for the information you need when using Steam, including account linking and switching, login methods, and World availability.1. I already have an existing account created with an email address or a Simple Login (SNS) account.Can I use my existing account to play on Steam?You can transfer your existing em","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T02:16:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670590","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5019180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:22:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:22:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5019180":"2026-10-26T16:22:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5019180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:22:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:22:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:22:27Z"},"5129800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:22:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:22:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:22:28Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5019180","app_id":5019180,"app_scope":"